Here is the root cause:
The bug was caused by attempting to modify a field in a const structure (`struct rtw_chip_info`), which led to a core dump due to an access violation when the code tried to write to the `ch_param` array. This structure was intended to be immutable, but the 8821c implementation required it to be mutable, resulting in a page fault.

